    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GP - Audit Orchestrator\nSEO + GEO audit of a website, from sitemap to ranked backlog. Built with n8n + Claude Haiku 5.5.\n\n**How to run:** set the scope in SetAuditConfig → Execute workflow.\n**Output:** Google Sheet backlog (tab \"Backlog\"), failed pages (tab \"Failed\"), summary email with run health.\n\n**Sub-workflows:** GP - Collect URLs → GP - Audit Page (→ GP - Rule Checks + GP - Claude GEO Review) → GP - Score & Prioritize\n**If the whole run crashes:** GP - Error Notifier sends an alert email.\n",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 2112,
        "color": "#A45051"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -976
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b363a9fa-ac19-436d-89f0-209a8f5fa189",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Settings\n- **SetAuditConfig** is the only place to change the audit: which sitemaps, how many pages per type (999 = all), sheet link.\n- **ClearBacklog** empties the Backlog tab (keeps the headers), so each run starts fresh.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 704,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -608
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "d2e6690f-92bd-42e6-a8af-2f5211fa8460",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Collect and audit pages\n- **CollectUrls:** builds the page list from the sitemap (legal pages left out).\n- **AuditPage:** runs once **per page**. If one page fails, the others continue.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        656,
        -608
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "99a3f3d9-8a85-45c8-9d9d-e43daab54f42",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Rank and report\n- **Prioritize:** ranks all findings (impact × effort → Quick Win / Big Bet / Fill-in / Deprioritize).\n- **WriteBacklog:** writes the ranked list to the sheet.\n- **BuildSummary + SendSummary:** one email with page counts, top 5 Quick Wins and **run health**: warns if >30% of pages failed, >30% got no valid Claude score, or a Claude quote wasn't found on the page.",
        "height": 496,
        "width": 912,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1120,
        -608
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "94779e8f-e9b2-4921-a3a9-f2aff4b9bb5a",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Failed pages\nA page that can't be loaded (404, timeout, redirect 301) comes out of AuditPage's error output.\nIt is logged in the \"Failed\" tab with time, URL and error, and the run continues.\nThe \"Failed\" tab is never cleared: it is the history of all failures.",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 2112,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        -80
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "f1cb5651-68ac-4dcb-b71a-6b67266780f0",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    }
  ],
